          .crateApiCoreCryptoCoreIsVerified(that: this, chatId: chatId);

  /// Seals the file key of a prepared, not yet run, receive ticket for
  /// `chat_id`: a 0x20 blob (AAD `kept-file-key` ‖ chat id) the app stores
